ation': {'description': ['A knowledge distillation method specifically designed for Transformer-based models, used to transfer knowledge from a large teacher model (e.g., BERT) to a smaller student model (e.g., TinyBERT).', 'A knowledge distillation method specifically designed for Transformer networks, transferring knowledge from a teacher model (BERT) to a student model (TinyBERT).', 'A specific type of knowledge distillation focused on the Transformer layers of the model.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2]}, 'Task-specific distillation': {'description': ["The second stage of TinyBERT's training, focusing on improving performance on specific downstream tasks by using a task-specific dataset.", 'A distillation approach focused on transferring knowledge related to specific tasks from a teacher model to a student model.', 'A key procedure in the TinyBERT learning framework, focused on distilling knowledge specific to a particular task.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 2, 3]}, 'General distillation': {'description': ["The initial stage of TinyBERT's training, providing a good initialization for the task-specific distillation.", 'A key procedure in the TinyBERT learning framework, focused on distilling general linguistic knowledge.', 'A method proposed for initializing TinyBERT, where it learns knowledge from intermediate layers of the teacher BERT during pre-training.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 2, 3]}, 'Data augmentation': {'description': ['The process of expanding the task-specific training set, using techniques like word-level replacement with GloVe embeddings.', 'A key procedure in the TinyBERT learning framework, used to augment the training data.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 2]}, 'GLUE Tasks': {'description': ['The specific natural language understanding tasks within the General Language Understanding Evaluation (GLUE) benchmark that TinyBERT was evaluated on. These tasks are not explic